ta Engineer"},{"text":"Database Performance Engineer"}]},{"type":"h","text":"What Employers May Test"},{"type":"h","text":"SQL"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Explain INNER JOIN vs LEFT JOIN."},{"text":"Find the second-highest salary."},{"text":"Find duplicate records."},{"text":"Calculate monthly revenue."},{"text":"Use a window function."},{"text":"Explain CTEs."}]},{"type":"h","text":"DBMS"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"What is normalisation?"},{"text":"What is an index?"},{"text":"What is a transaction?"},{"text":"Explain ACID."},{"text":"What is a deadlock?"},{"text":"What is a foreign key?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Administration"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"How would you back up a database?"},{"text":"How would you restore it?"},{"text":"How would you troubleshoot a slow query?"},{"text":"How would you investigate database downtime?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Security"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"How do you prevent SQL injection?"},{"text":"What is least privilege?"},{"text":"How would you protect sensitive database credentials?"}]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A master's degree is not mandatory for database careers."},{"type":"p","text":"Useful options include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Computer Science"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MCA"},{"text":"M.Sc. Computer Science"},{"text":"M.Sc. IT"},{"text":"M.Tech Computer Science"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"M.Sc. Data Science"},{"text":"M.Sc. Data Analytics"},{"text":"M.Tech Data Engineering"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Management"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MBA IT"},{"text":"MBA Business Analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a technical database career, MCA/M.Sc./M.Tech + strong practical skills can be useful, but professional experience often becomes more important as the career progresses."},{"type":"h","text":"Government / Public-Sector Route"},{"type":"p","text":"Database professionals can work on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Government information systems"},{"text":"E-governance platforms"},{"text":"Public-sector databases"},{"text":"Banking systems"},{"text":"Healthcare information systems"},{"text":"Education platforms"},{"text":"State IT systems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential job titles may include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Database Administrator"},{"text":"System Administrator"},{"text":"Database Analyst"},{"text":"Technical Assistant"},{"text":"IT Officer"},{"text":"Programmer/Developer"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Eligibility varies by recruitment notification."}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Relevant master's programs:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Computer Science"},{"text":"Database Systems"},{"text":"Data Engineering"},{"text":"Data Science"},{"text":"Information Systems"},{"text":"Cloud Computing"},{"text":"Software Engineering"},{"text":"Distributed Systems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For database engineering, programs involving:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Databases","Distributed Systems","Cloud","Data Engineering"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"are particularly valuable."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"DBA Route"},{"type":"h","text":"Database Executive"},{"type":"h","text":"Junior DBA"},{"type":"h","text":"Database Administrator"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior DBA"},{"type":"h","text":"Lead DBA"},{"type":"h","text":"Database Architect"},{"type":"h","text":"Database Engineering Route"},{"type":"h","text":"Database Executive"},{"type":"flow","items":["Database Engineer","Senior Database Engineer","Staff Database Engineer","Principal Database Engineer","Data Platform Architect"]},{"type":"h","text":"Data Engineering Route"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong SQL/database professional can transition into:"},{"type":"h","text":"Database Executive"},{"type":"flow","items":["Data Engineer","Senior Data Engineer","Staff Data Engineer","Data Architect 